  "4cf1a4300e73c259af9c7ad103f0d01819a547900b9a64eb4ed089655185608c": "Planning and control engineer",
  "bd0269c82d44255c9588eb2e02f2c0d67b690646e0922fa3cf05da597e780660": "A little about the role of an aerospace plant in the missile and space systems division in the foreign currency division division, a planning and control engineer is required. The role includes: •Preparation and management of work plans for all projects in the assembly line of satellite production and monitoring progress. •Preparation, analysis and presentation of a multi-year work plan. •Examination of load and its analysis, analysis of bottlenecks. •Managing and controlling risks in each project. •Execution, analysis and reporting of data related to the progress of the project vis-à-vis the relevant parties. • Ongoing work with the factory outline. What we're looking for • Undergraduate degree in Industrial Engineering and Management - compulsory. •Has at least two years of experience in the field - mandatory. •Control and familiarity with MS-Project and Excel – mandatory. • Good English proficiency-mandatory. •Control of the operation of the PS module in the SAP systems – advantage. You may be interested to know that the Missile and Space Systems Division designs, develops and provides a variety of solutions in the fields of missile systems and space technologies. Space factory is considered Israel's space home and develops a wide range of satellites, ground control stations, mission centers and launchers. We invite you to take part in the field of AIT satellite integration, which is responsible for the process of assembling the satellites, operating environmental tests (vibrations, thermal tests), operating the satellite at a launch site, installation and testing on the verge of launch.",
  "4e3617f5aebcd64611807817693bbb1ef916f9c3227861798456a7c90bec5aab": "Payroll tax accountant",
  "b830f76ef056b4c82a1eb42d7ae2b9b3b9f51c7936bdee1a173109e605f50cde": "A little about the position at the company's headquarters of IAI requires a CPA for the field of payroll taxation including: • Payroll control in the fields of taxation, social security and reserve duty - the employee is required to delve into individual taxation issues (including social security and reserve calculations), examine the correctness of employees' salaries, implement regulatory changes in wages, examine payments and receipts in reserve subjects, alongside service to the employee. • The employee is required to initiate new controls and refine the control processes, in order to pay accurate and timely wages. • The position is intended for a beginning CPA and is subject to the head of a field. What we're looking for • Bachelor's degree in Business Administration/ Economics - compulsory • Certification as an accountant - mandatory • Up to 5 years experience as an accountant - mandatory • High level Excel - mandatory • Background in individual taxation - significant advantage • Good level English You may be interested in the opinion of the salary center Say about the salary payments to all IAI employees. The work in management is professional work in the field of specialization, while providing service to the company's employees and colleagues.",
  "ebd28ae7df450ec2ad00d9822b418b28aa0496a438f9e1808c09daf091fe2c1f": "Head of Recruitment",
  "05c76d1cb11edafbe9974d92bc3dc512c59268a1ef8fe8087eea4682e95bb5b2": "A little bit about the role for the Malam plant in the missile and aerospace systems division The head of the recruitment division is required including: • Responsibility for the implementation of the divisional recruitment plan • Management of the recruitment team and operation coordinators • Measurement and control of the annual recruitment plan and meeting the goals of KPI • Ongoing management of the status of the positions and candidates in the division • Operation and promotion of the recruitment processes in the division from end to end • Work with many interfaces including human capital, security, diagnostic institutes and more • Reporting recruitment data to the division's management, human capital and managers recruiting what we are looking for prerequisites: • Holder of Israeli citizenship - abroad in it • Academic education - compulsory • At least 3 years of experience in end-to-end recruitment • Team management experience - mandatory • Full command of Office software, including Excel andPowerPoint - Leadership criteria required: • Excellent interpersonal communication ability • Very good interpersonal relations with administrative subordinates and colleagues • Leadership ability and delegation of candidate submission powers can be performed until 10/11/2026 at 4:00 PM. The submission of the application includes: return to the attached questionnaire and compliance with the threshold conditions. Suitable candidates/s will be invited for a personal interview and if necessary for compatibility tests. Submission of the application constitutes the candidate's consent to conduct tests and inspections as required, including an investigation for security clearance. The committee does not undertake to summon all applicants for an interview and/or for tests and/or to recommend the candidacy of any of them. You may be interested to know that leading a recruitment team during a challenging recruitment period and a changing employment market",
  "dcbb913c27a084c75e34cbb271cac77b5983e5ce75a3bfb6141dbb5c3a281060": "Business Development Project Manager",
  "e33d1efb928f8d55fa35d864f0a4b49b7d7c665a31c860ef4d05e8a5efd15068": "A little about the role of Tamam in the Missile and Space Systems Division requires a business project manager, leading projects and business development with customers in Israel and abroad, expanding the customer base and creating strategic partnerships. The role includes: •Leading business projects with customers in Israel •Negotiating with customers and business partners • High marketing ability – understanding the market and the development of new trends •Construction and management of work plans, risks and project budget • Proven meeting goals and closing tasks on a set schedule • Business development with customers in Israel and abroad •Locating potential customers, seeking business partnerships and strategic initiatives •Employee motivation, synchronization between all parties involved in the projects •Ability to identify and exploit business opportunities •Reporting the status of the project (business and economic) vis-à-vis the Customer and management of the factory •Willingness to work overtime if necessary What we are looking for are the job requirements: • Electronics / Electrical engineer - Mandatory Bachelor of Engineering (BSC) – Advantage •Working with unit 40 – Advantage •Experience of at least 4 years in managing a multidisciplinary business project with customers in Israel or abroad -Mandatory • High service awareness and ability to work and present with customers in Israel and abroad – Mandatory • Professional knowledge in the field of inertial navigation – Advantage You may be interested in knowing Tamam factory in the foreign exchange division in the aerospace industry, develops and produces a wide range of inertial navigation systems. The systems are integrated in Israel and around the world in airborne systems, marine systems and ground systems. The plant will fund many years of experience in developing and manufacturing the most advanced systems in the world installed in defense systems, space systems and precise attack systems.",
  "015fc5b18839840083114117196d462cf0243f00543effcdeec7390e707ebf75": "Head of Marketing Communications and Customer Relations",
  "0bb1290f25e54260457f51823949aa7f6d05c9a641f4eebefc6443f218276dcb": "A little bit about the role of organizing marketing in the aviation division requires the head of marketing communications and customer relations The role includes: • Management of internal marketing communications system in the division • Management of ongoing interface and POC division vis-à-vis the company's media and spokespeople for publications inside and outside the company • Creating marketing content, presentations and promotional videos for factories and the division • Divisional leadership of preparations for exhibitions • Maintenance of the division's website and management of the historical archive of the aviation division • Publications in professional media and digital updates in the division and in the company • Leading internal campaigns Sea and international • Responsibility for the creative and design of the division, while maintaining a uniform, innovative, accurate and impressive visual language, adapted to the worlds of aviation and technology • Full responsibility for the development of creative concepts, branding and event design, the production of marketing and digital materials and working with external suppliers • Multiple trips abroad What we are looking for are prerequisites: • Holder of Israeli citizenship • Bachelor's degree - Economics/Business Administration/ Marketing/ Law/ Industry and Management/ Engineering • At least 5 years of experience in leading and managing marketing communications and interfaces with his client A. In Israel and abroad • At least 3 years of experience in managing a team of employees directly • At least 3 years of experience in building and developing a creative language, formulating and executing marketing communication strategy and work plans • At least 3 years of experience in leading exhibitions and conferences in Israel and abroad • High level English (reading, writing, speaking) Additional criteria (advantageous): • Direct communication and interface management with foreign customers in Israel and abroad • Leading customer experience activities • Management of the continuous visitation program of customers from Israel and abroad • Experience in Matrix management Leadership criteria: • Leadership ability and delegation of authority • Working in a systemic approach with cross-company cooperation • Formulating a business and organizational strategy leading to technological innovation • Leadership that promotes and harnesses cultural and organizational change processes • Aiming for business success The application can be performed 10/01/2026 at 16:00 The application includes: return to the attached questionnaire and compliance with the threshold conditions. Suitable candidates/s will be invited for a personal interview and if necessary for compatibility tests. Submission of the application constitutes the candidate's consent to conduct tests and inspections as required, including an investigation for security clearance. The committee does not undertake to summon all applicants for an interview and/or for tests and/or to recommend the candidacy of any of them. The referral is intended for both men and women. You may be interested in the opinion of an aviation division, one of the leading divisions in the aerospace industry, specializing in providing advanced technological solutions for all the needs of civil and military aviation in Israel and around the world. The division combines engineering innovation and the world's most advanced development and production capabilities, and provides end-to-end solutions – from the idea, design and engineering development stage to full operational delivery. Aviation is a global one-stop-shop for civil and military aviation. The division's personnel lead complex, groundbreaking and impactful technological projects in the global aviation market while committed to meeting the business goals Make The Impossible Possible - to make the impossible possible through personal excellence, professionalism, creativity, innovation, collaboration and above all - people. Our work environment fosters excellence, initiative, and personal development, giving all employees the tools to make an impact, lead, and be partners in shaping the future of global aviation.",
  "10b7d69a9c33eca78bda3db5a5ff0aa1e4eea04f0a958aec7f3cc1fa56020f59": "Head of Purchase Planning and Control",
  "3fce1c0a6b206cc442649ed6ba8a713195f88357e4a7d943131c74a9d0fa9ca0": "A little about the role of the manufacturing technologies factory in the aviation division requires the head of the planning and control field to acquire management and lead all the planning and control activities of the procurement in the manufacturing technologies factory. Perception of overall responsibility for all inspections carried out in procurement and planning of the annual budget. In addition, you led changes, improvements and reports for the entire aviation division on the above issues. The role includes managing a team of analysts, advanced data analysis and improving work processes in information systems. The role includes: • Managing and leading the field of cataloging and MRP controls for the entire aviation division • Training new and existing purchasing employees on the control issues in their field (DASHBOARD procurement) and transferring them to a training test for obtaining a property code • Analyzing inventory reports and building an inventory consumption forecast in the entire division, recommending the continuity of inventories and presenting these issues to the aviation division headquarters • Concentration and leading inventory committees (surplus inventory, active inventory, scratches, etc.) for the entire aviation division • Concentration of procurement risk management and MRP deviations of the manufacturing technologies company. Including close work with the heads of the procurement administration, identifying the root problems and providing real solutions • building an annual procurement budget in synchronization with all the business lines, procurement managers and finance managers in the division • developing and defining key performance indicators for procurement (KPI) and improving procurement processes in analytics and BI tools and implementing them in the various procurement managers in the division What we are looking for are prerequisites: • Holder of Israeli citizenship • Holder of a bachelor's degree in industrial engineering and management / logistics / economy/industrial management • Professional experience over 3 years in the field of planning and control of procurement • Experience in managing a team of At least 5 employees directly • Experience in inventory management valued at approximately50Mdollar annually • Over 3 years of experience in the SAP system in the MM module, EWM Excel and Office systems Additional criteria (advantage): • Master's degree • High level of English (reading, writing and speaking) • Systemic and analytical vision at a high level • Proven experience in matrix management of over 5 years in the field of procurement Leadership criteria: • Leadership ability and delegation of authority • Working with a systemic approach while collaborating across the company • Formulation of a business and organizational strategy leading to technological innovation • Leadership that promotes and harnesses cultural and organizational change processes • Intended for business success The application can be performed 06/10/2026 at 16:00 The application includes: return to the attached questionnaire and compliance with the threshold conditions. Suitable candidates/s will be invited for a personal interview and if necessary for compatibility tests. Submission of the application constitutes the candidate's consent to conduct tests and inspections as required, including an investigation for security clearance. The committee does not undertake to summon all applicants for an interview and/or for tests and/or to recommend the candidacy of any of them. A referral is intended for both men and women. You may be interested to know that the aviation division of Israel Aerospace Industries is involved in all aspects of the aviation industry, from planning and development, through engineering and manufacturing of aviation structures and entire aircraft, to testing and approvals. The aviation division of Israel Aerospace Industries provides comprehensive and quality maintenance services for aircraft, engines and components, under one roof. These services include heavy maintenance, modifications and improvements, upgrades to civilian and military aircraft, as well as the world's leading service, with over50 years of experience in converting passenger aircraft to cargo aircraft.",
  "1b1acd192d43c22911a4956eb41f082bf2a13c92ed576ec81b9ae079b0f25598": "Director of Customer Relations and International Marketing",
  "c075f1c5c4a6ca634881b852fc271d755ed545e45e04d45b815ac7a7d4ea07a9": "A little about the role of Lahav Aviation Structures Plant in the Aviation Division requires a customer relations and international marketing manager. •Marketing for the international market, targeting North America. •Management of systems, databases, budgets, market risk management and competition. • Marketing communications: Accessories, publications, PR branding. •Events and ceremonies, visits and hosting of clients and international delegations. •Coordination and planning of conferences and exhibitions. • Business intelligence, surveys and market research and business forecasts. What we're looking for • Academic degree holder or mandatory engineer. •Over 5 years of experience in marketing and marcom for the international market -mandatory. •Experience in writing and editing professional, business and marketing content for the international market -a must. • Native English level. •Entrepreneurship, creativity, work interfaces and positive energies. • Business understanding and market analysis, systems and databases management. •Background in the security / aviation market -advantage. •Experience in the social worlds -an advantage. • Advanced graphics and design and production capability -an advantage. •Experience in managing marketing systems -an advantage. You may be interested to know that we are looking for an international customer relations and marketing manager for the Lahav factory in the aviation division provides a wide range of aviation structures for the most advanced military and civilian aircraft in the world. The blade has advanced infrastructures and state-of-the-art technologies to support the production and assembly of aircraft and helicopter structural parts. The factory specializes in the manufacture of wings, tails and other body parts made of metal and complex materials.",
  "583f226f95e5c1d31ac029f56244c80a0521e08c392ba00cd7019e64b6f5d6c8": "Secretary",
  "a9e508c41a71ae0550c8858a54fe22adb3256a1dce1fd3f0d7c43120c5442d73": "A little about the role at the Midtown Tel Aviv Strategy Headquarters requires a secretary. The role includes: • Providing an ongoing administrative response to the staff of the Headquarters of Israel and assistance in the team's tasks. • Managing team logs and assisting with team assignments in Israel. • Coordinating meetings with managers from the company and outside the company. • Working with senior management and multiple interfaces in the organization. • Working with the Ministry of Defense and the IDF. • Preparation of meeting rooms, coordination of discussions and monitoring of tasks and deliverables. What we're looking for • Control of Office applications - mandatory. • Excellent service and interpersonal skills. • Willingness to overtime if necessary. • Ability to order and organize. • Ability to work with a wide range of interfaces and manage several tasks at the same time. • Assertiveness, discretion, reliability and experience in working with senior management. You may be interested to know a very attractive work environment, pleasant people, integration into the Est team and Israel.",
  "b2cb664e1ec6e55534e7e14efbaf4b60fba0f5006f2373de45ed0d2738361a02": "Head of Quality Engineering",
  "ffaf5709434da6447047152860605b0aecd51f0a239e94ed2ab3fc5d887d4a55": "A little about the role of Malat Technologies in the military aircraft division requires the head of the field of quality engineering, experienced in quality management and in-depth familiarity with the various quality standards, with an emphasis on AS9100. Leading and managing a team in the field of quality engineering in the quality management manager, in the fields of production, procurement and logistics, internal audits, external audits and customer audits including leading and accompanying processes improvement in the various fields of business and continuous improvement of the quality system The role includes: • Leading lateral processes - internal audits, certifications for the various quality standards (AS9100) and customer audits • Presenting quality status to the plant management. Presentation of the main indicators (KPIs), the gaps and the main activities in the field of quality • Raising awareness of quality in the division - conducting quality conferences, preparing and leading quality management surveys • Leading quality processes in the field of procurement and logistics- coverage and supplier certification • Improving the quality of suppliers and handling and effective closing of complaints to the supplier (UR) + MRB suppliers and accompanying procurement and logistics personnel • Leading quality investigations/events related to the supply chain • Improving production processes and infrastructure (method cards and processes) • Preparing plans and requirements FAI • Leading (as chairman) and MRB materials committee, Analysis of discrepancies and lessons learned to improve production processes • Determination and monitoring of the implementation of corrective activity in quality notices • Determination of production quality indices, objectives and periodic monitoring to examine effectiveness • Management of a team of about 15 quality personnel - quality engineers and auditors • Reporting to the head of the quality manager in cement technologies • Integrated work - area (production) and office, and sometimes - work meetings abroad What are we looking for threshold conditions: • Holder of Israeli citizenship • Has an engineering/ engineering education • Proven experience of at least 5 years in quality management positions in the world of aviation • NI Sivan Managing a Team Directly • Proven experience in working with regulatory bodies such as: the Standards Institute, certification bodies and customers • Good command of the English language (reading, writing and speaking) Additional criteria (advantage): • CQE/CMQ • Experience with Civil Aviation Authority • Ability to work collaboratively with all organizational entities Leadership criteria: • Working in a team and operating and managing a team of employees • Good ability to persuade and convey messages • Ability to analyze and make decisions • Strategic thinker, systemic vision and proven ability to lead changes and implement processes • Transportation Culture for improving processes and streamlining • Sharing information (work plans, goals, etc.) and creating a culture of learning and mentoring • Leading service awareness to internal and external customers The application can be performed 11/10/2026 at 4:00 PM The application submission includes: Reply to the attached questionnaire and compliance with the threshold conditions. Suitable candidates/s will be invited for a personal interview and if necessary for compatibility tests. Submission of the application constitutes the candidate's consent to conduct tests and inspections as required, including an investigation for security clearance. The committee does not undertake to summon all applicants for an interview and/or for tests and/or to recommend the candidacy of any of them. The referral is intended for both men and women. You may be interested to know that the cement technology factory of the IAI is the center of operation of the military division. The role is challenging and interesting, partnering with all the most amazing projects in the aviation world, working with all the different project factors. A true influencer and leader of a team of quality people",
  "e7679c76809b3374a4de46164f3da0705df4c6d4a957693a214c78bc314cfe9b": "ComponentE/Maritza Mechanical in Production",
  "351aae968c2bb0f56171e4b9cc98a2495029e955a277000d0adc7c7b3b7ddaa1": "About Us ACS Motion Control is a leading global motion control company that develops and manufactures advanced motion control systems for a variety of industries around the world. We are looking for people with technical access, responsibility, and the ability to work accurately, who will join our production team. What does the role include? As part of the role, you will be part of the production process of advanced electronic systems, from the assembly stage to the finished product. Responsibilities include: software loading and configuration of electronic systems. Execution of final inspections of the products prior to their discharge to the customer. Mechanical assembly of electronic products and systems. Work in accordance with work instructions and quality procedures. Working with computerized systems and dedicated tools. Collaboration with production and quality teams. What are we looking for? Accuracy, order, and rigorous workability. Ability to work under load and multitask. Excellent interpersonal skills and ability to work in a team. Technical access and quick learning ability. Fine motor skills and good technical skills. Experience in mechanical assembly – a significant advantage. Correct additional requirements for overtime work according to production needs. If you like technical work, enjoy learning new systems and are looking to integrate into a leading technological company with a professional and stable work environment – we will be happy to get to know you!",
