ists, Physiotherapists, Psychotherapists and more Contact Business Login Customers Login Get Started > Open an account for free > Customer Service Representative and Technical Support (Typology) /Customer Service Representative Jobs and Technical Support (Typology) Updated on This is some text inside of a div block. This is some text inside of a div block. This is some text inside of a div block. Posted: 2/3/2026 This is your opportunity to enter and be part of a groundbreaking company in the field of business solutions. If you're looking for a place where you can deliver exceptional service, work in an amazing team, and be part of a SaaS revolution, we're looking for you! We're hiring a representative for Tipulog's service and support department. It's a role that combines customer service, technical orientation, troubleshooting, conservation calls, and gathering insights from the field that go directly to the product and development. If you love solving problems, talking to people, and influencing a product - this is the place for you. Responsibilities of the first point of contact for customers: responding to written and telephone inquiries (support, malfunctions, guidance). Diagnosing malfunctions and troubleshooting: identifying the source of the malfunction, clear explanation to the customer, documentation and monitoring until closure. Customer retention: Handling sensitive inquiries, reducing friction, reducing abandonment and strengthening satisfaction. Gathering requirements and insights from the field: identifying recurring needs, gaps and improvements. Writing quality documentation: opening organized texts (bug/feature), reconstruction, material combination, prioritization. Working closely with product/development/QA: clear information transfer, helping to validate solutions, and improving processes and automation. Job requirements Required Customer service/technical support experience in a software / SaaS environment. High technical orientation: understan